{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美國佛羅里達州有多架車相撞，釀成至少兩死、多人受傷，死者包括一名中學生。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事校巴車身翻側，車窗碎裂。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GfWYeUAslE1791243466.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在佛州中部溫特黑文市，載有39人、大部分是高中生的校巴，當地周一早上六時許在公路行駛期間，跟一架越過行車線的汽車迎面相撞，導致校巴部分車胎飛脫，之後再有一架吉普車跟校巴相撞。警方指，一名高中生與吉普車司機死亡，另有多人傷勢嚴重。救護人員安排直升機，將他們送院搶救。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0600_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20266agmdVHaUe1791243463.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.CRASH-0600_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於越線汽車的司機接受問話，警方暫時未有起訴任何人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T23:58:33.545970+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}